---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <div class="footer-logo-row">
          <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="AITT Labs" width="28" height="28" class="footer-logo-icon" />
          <span class="footer-logo">AI TalenTech Labs</span>
        </div>
        <p>AI 人才科技實驗室<br>用 AI 重新定義人才發展與組織轉型</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>產品</h4>
        <a href="/products/">AI Interviewer</a>
        <a href="/products/">iCoach360</a>
        <a href="/products/">PPTutor</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>服務</h4>
        <a href="/institute/">AI 人才科技研訓院</a>
        <a href="/consulting/">顧問服務</a>
        <a href="/consulting/">Systemaster</a>
        <a href="/consulting/">FlowMaster</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>連結</h4>
        <a href="/about/">關於我們</a>
        <a href="/contact/">聯絡我們</a>
        <a href="https://aitti.online" target="_blank">課程平台</a>
        <a href="https://substack.com/@johnliontw" target="_blank">Substack</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>&copy; {year} AI TalenTech Labs. All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="footer-social">
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@johnliontw" target="_blank" aria-label="YouTube">YT</a>
        <a href="https://substack.com/@johnliontw" target="_blank" aria-label="Substack">SS</a>
        <a href="mailto:service@attlabs.org" aria-label="Email">Email</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 4rem 0 2rem;
    background: var(--primary);
  }
  .footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .footer-logo-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .footer-logo-icon {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }
  .footer-logo {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-light), var(--gold));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .footer-brand p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .footer-col h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .footer-col a {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  .footer-col a:hover { color: var(--accent-light); }
  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .footer-bottom p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .footer-social {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .footer-social a {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  .footer-social a:hover { color: var(--accent-light); }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>
